# Design mockups must NEVER be deployed to production (2026-07-02 mockup leak; TK).
# `vercel deploy` uploads local files regardless of git tracking, so reference
# mockups dropped into public/ would otherwise ship live. Block the mockup CLASS
# by pattern -- narrowly, so REAL assets are never excluded.
#
# KEEP (do NOT match these -- they are live, referenced or rollback assets):
#   public/hero_bg_8final.png, public/hero_bg_8final_mobile.png  (live Hero bg)
#   public/arena_image.png                                       (landing/OG)
#   public/arena_hero_bg.png, public/arena_hero_bg_frameless.png (kept for rollback)
#   public/oxxovo_logo.png
#
# BLOCK (mockups only):
public/ChatGPT Image*
public/*_reference.*
public/*_mockup.*
public/*_mock.*
